# D3-LI-008: Opaque pigment mixing is not averaging two RGB colours
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 acrylic_red 2g
add v2 acrylic_blue 2g
add v3 acrylic_red 1g
add v3 acrylic_blue 1g
look v1
look v2
look v3
stir v3 200rpm 10s
look v3
measure v3 balance
inspect
